  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Armored plates sculpted to fit your body are fused with your skin. When these are installed, they can be customized for appearance and stylistic purposes, potentially making them difficult to detect or immediately obvious at a glance. At tier 2, the plating becomes reactive, and you can cause it to harden against certain attacks.</p><p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-4404d26e-7fff-ef63-768a-3c3252f6c11b\"><br /></strong><strong>Tier 1. </strong>You gain a +1 bonus to AC. You also gain +1 to Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution saving throws.</p>",
